<refentry version="5.1"
  xml:id="Api.SilikoVersionMinor"
  xmlns="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook">
<refmeta>
  <refentrytitle>SilikoVersionMinor</refentrytitle>
</refmeta>

<refnamediv>
  <refname><varname>SilikoVersionMinor</varname></refname>
  <refpurpose>Integer holding minor version number</refpurpose>
</refnamediv>

<refsynopsisdiv>
<programlisting language="C">#include &lt;SilikoCore/Version.h&gt;</programlisting>
<programlisting language="C">extern const unsigned int SilikoVersionMinor;</programlisting>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsection>
<title>Description</title>
<para>The <varname>SilikoVersionMinor</varname> value holds rhe
minor version number of the Siliko Core library. The minor version is
incremented (and the patch version number is reset to zero)
when a non-breaking addition is made to Siliko Core’s API.</para>
</refsection>
</refentry>
